  "protocol_type": "Layered LR-WPAN protocol. IEEE 802.15.4 PHY (O-QPSK/DSSS PPDU) and MAC (CSMA-CA, superframe/GTS, four frame types) carry the Zigbee NWK (routed) / APS (endpoint/cluster) / ZDO / ZCL stack. Packet-based; not a register read/write bus.",
